'manager' is a program that can be run with the following syntax:
   manager
 | manager "FearlessCommand Message"
 | manager FearlessCommandServe
 | manager path
where "FearlessCommand Message" is a double quote, the constant FearlessCommand, a valid Message, a double quote.
FearlessCommandServe is the literal constant string FearlessCommandServe
and path is an absolute path as the current OS represents them.

Message ::= Show | Show projectName | Register base16 | Quit | Reset | ConnectEclipse base16 | EditMetadata base16
  | OpenWithOrShortcut base16 | OpenWithOrShortcut base16 projectName typeName
  | Run projectName | Compile projectName | Check projectName | Terminate projectName
  | DeleteCache projectName | Forget projectName | Fix projectName | Kind projectName kind
  | Mount projectName typeName projectName | Unmount projectName typeName
  | Attenuate projectName typeName typeName* | SelectMains projectName typeName*
kind ::= idle | code | dataRead | dataEdit
projectName ::= a 'valid segment'
typeName ::= (?!(con|prn|aux|nul|com[1-9]|lpt[1-9])[.])[a-z][a-z0-9_]*[.]_*[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*'*
base16 ::= Base16:([0-9A-F][0-9A-F])+
Origin ::= program | person
Answer ::= Applied output | Refused error
CannotStart ::= NoDisplay | NoLockFile | NoManagerFolderCreation | BadArgument
FatalError ::= CorruptedManagerFolder | NotHoldingFearlessExtension

