## Info files

```
projects.info, manager.info ::= info
info ::= ws (string | list | object) ws
list ::= [[] ws []] | [[] info ([,] info)* []]
object ::= [{] ws [}] | [{] member ([,] member)* [}]        the keys of one object all different
member ::= ws string ws [:] info
string ::= ["](strChar | [\\]["\\n])*["]
strChar ::= a character of the Fearless character set, other than " and \
ws ::= [ \n]*

taggedText ::= Str:str | UStr:uStr | base16           a path in an Info file
str ::= strAtom strMore* [ ]*
strMore ::= [ ]*[+] strAtom | [ ]*[|^] strAtom?
strAtom ::= [ ]*"[^"\n]*" | [ ]*`[^`\n]*` | [ ]*[(] str [)]          parentheses at most 100 deep
uStr ::= uStrAtom uStrMore* [ ]*
uStrMore ::= [ ]*[+] uStrAtom | [ ]*[|^] uStrAtom? | [ ]*[.]u codePoints
codePoints ::= [ ]*["]codePoint([ ]codePoint)*["] | [ ]*[`]codePoint([ ]codePoint)*[`]
codePoint ::= [0-9A-F]{1,6}                          at most 10FFFF, and not from D800 to DFFF
uStrAtom ::= strAtom [.]u codePoints? | [ ]*[(] uStr [)]

text(string): \" is ", \\ is \, \n is the newline, each strChar is itself
text(Str:s) = the Str that the Fearless expression s evaluates to
text(UStr:u) = the UStr that the Fearless expression u evaluates to
text(Base16:h) = the path whose bytes are the pairs of h

tagged(p) = Str: then p.escape       if p is a Str
          = UStr: then p.escape      if p is a UStr and not a Str
          = Base16: of the bytes of p   otherwise

"C:\data\hello"     the path C:\data\hello, written in an Info file as "path": "Str:\"C:\\data\\hello\""
"Hello"|"World"     Hello, a newline, World, written as "Str:\"Hello\"|\"World\""
"caf".u"00E9"       caf then the character 00E9, written as "UStr:\"caf\".u\"00E9\""
```

