## Project states

```
State ::= busy | invalid | idle | dataRead | dataEdit | outOfDate | compiled

state(p) = busy        if p is 'busy'
         = invalid     if invalid(p)
         = idle        if p.kind == idle
         = p.kind      if p.kind == dataRead or p.kind == dataEdit
         = outOfDate   if Coordinator.check(p) gives State.outOfDate
         = compiled    otherwise

invalid(p)  iff  p.kind != idle, and one of these holds:
                 the project folder of p is not 'well shaped'
                 the project folder of p holds more than one marker
                 .config/icon of p holds more than one PNG file, or a PNG file that can not be read
                 p.kind == code and Coordinator.check(p) gives State.invalid
problem(p) = the error naming one of the causes of invalid(p) that hold
compiledMains(p) = the .mains of the .manifest of State.compiled, when Coordinator.check(p) gives State.compiled

manager.autoCheck(p)
A The manager reads the project folder of p, and finds state(p) and compiledMains(p).
