manager.autoCheck(p)
A p is 'busy'.
B invalid(p), or state(p) == outOfDate, or the manager can not reach the project folder of p.
C Each 'mains chain' that makes p 'busy' ends.
D The Output of the project of each of those 'mains chains' holds an error naming p and the main that was running.

